Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Source: https://github.com/GOcontroll/GOcontroll-HMI-Demo
Upstream-Name: gocontroll-hmi-demo
Upstream-Contact: GOcontroll <info@gocontroll.com>
Comment:
 The binary package embeds glyph bitmaps rendered from Montserrat and from
 Font Awesome Free. Those are not under the Expat licence that covers the rest
 of this package; see the src/fonts/* stanza below. The full licence texts are
 shipped in /usr/share/doc/gocontroll-hmi-demo/licenses/.

