Files:
 src/fonts/lv_font_montserrat_14_ext.c
Copyright:
 2026 GOcontroll <info@gocontroll.com>
 2011 The Montserrat Project Authors
 2022 Fonticons, Inc.
License: OFL-1.1 and CC-BY-4.0 and Expat
 The C file itself is Expat, but the glyph bitmaps in it are rendered from
 Montserrat-Medium.ttf (SIL OFL 1.1, Copyright 2011 The Montserrat Project
 Authors, https://github.com/JulietaUla/Montserrat) and from Font Awesome Free
 5 (Copyright (c) 2022 Fonticons, Inc., https://fontawesome.com — icons under
 CC BY 4.0, font files under SIL OFL 1.1 with reserved font name "Font
 Awesome").
 .
 Full texts: /usr/share/doc/gocontroll-hmi-demo/licenses/Montserrat-OFL-1.1.txt
 and /usr/share/doc/gocontroll-hmi-demo/licenses/FontAwesome5-Free-LICENSE.txt
Comment:
 lv_font_montserrat_14, _24 and _36 are compiled in from the LVGL source tree
 and carry the same Montserrat copyright and OFL-1.1 terms.

