Files:
 gocontroll_demo
Copyright:
 2026 GOcontroll <info@gocontroll.com>
License: Expat
Comment:
 Prebuilt aarch64 binary of the GOcontroll Simulink demo model, generated by
 MathWorks Simulink Coder from a model owned by GOcontroll and committed here
 without separate source. The generated code and the resulting binary are
 GOcontroll's own work product and are distributed under the Expat licence
 above; the MathWorks toolchain used to produce it is not distributed with,
 or licensed by, this package.

Files:
 assets/*
 splash/assets/*
Copyright:
 2026 GOcontroll <info@gocontroll.com>
License: Expat
Comment:
 GOcontroll wordmarks, logos and Moduline HMI1 product photography. The Expat
 licence grants copyright permissions only and conveys no trademark rights:
 the GOcontroll name and logo remain GOcontroll trademarks and may not be used
 to imply endorsement of, or origin from, GOcontroll.

Files:
 thirdparty/lvgl/*
Copyright:
 2025 LVGL Kft
License: Expat
Comment:
 LVGL itself is Expat; see thirdparty/lvgl/LICENCE.txt, reproduced as
 licenses/LVGL-MIT-LICENCE.txt. LVGL is consumed as a git submodule, so these
 files are present only in a checked-out working tree, not in the git
 repository proper.
 .
 The upstream tree additionally bundles optional third-party libraries under
 licences other than Expat, each with its own LICENSE file in-tree:
 src/libs/frogfs (MPL-2.0), src/libs/vg_lite_driver (Vivante, proprietary),
 src/libs/gif (Apache-2.0), src/libs/lodepng and src/libs/nanovg (Zlib),
 src/libs/lz4 and src/stdlib/builtin TLSF (BSD), src/libs/barcode (BSD),
 src/libs/tjpgd (ChaN, custom permissive), src/libs/thorvg, src/libs/qrcode,
 src/libs/tiny_ttf and src/libs/FT800-FT813 (Expat).
 .
 None of these are built into this package: every corresponding LV_USE_* is
 off or undefined in lv_conf.h, and debian/rules configures with
 -DCONFIG_LV_USE_THORVG_INTERNAL=OFF. Only the LVGL core, the Linux DRM and
 evdev drivers, the software renderer and the Montserrat fonts are compiled.
 If this package ever ships a source package, each of the above needs its own
 stanza here.

